{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Taverna is a first person adventure in a world of online  taverns. Create and customize your own locale or explore others with up to 16 players (per lobby). Earn gold, complete challenges, unlock items and have fun with role-play.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize your tavern</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/extras/Posing-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1747355723\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paint </strong>walls, <strong>add forniture</strong>, <strong>lights</strong>, and <strong>decorations </strong>to create a unique atmosphere. Every detail in your tavern is yours to customize, making it a welcoming place for friends and fellow adventurers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Voice chat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/extras/Editor43-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1747355723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Communicate vocally</strong> with other players in fun and interactive ways. Organize stand-up comedy nights or just spend the night with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Freedom to create</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/extras/Drawing.gif?t=1747355723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Express yourself</strong> in a variety of ways: <strong>painting, decorating, playing instruments</strong>, and <strong>customizing the environment.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get immersed in a fantasy world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/extras/Customization.gif?t=1747355723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your look with different clothing presets and explore a cozy, fantasy tavern straight out of your favorite story or video game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Other features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from between more than <strong>15 roles</strong>. Whether you decide to be a <strong>cook</strong>, a <strong>bard</strong>, or simply a <strong>traveler</strong>, this choice will shape your role-play experience in Taverna by adding a special tag on top of your head.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn gold and use it to <strong>unlock unique items </strong>to progress your tavern. <strong>Chairs</strong>, <strong>pots</strong>, <strong>books</strong>, <strong>cutlery</strong>, <strong>ingredients</strong>, <strong>paints </strong>and so much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Participate in a variety of games and social activities, making every session unique. From classic tavern games to hosting themed events, Taverna is an ideal space for role-play gatherings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a new level of interactivity with <strong>physics</strong>. <strong>Throw</strong>, <strong>flip</strong>, <strong>eat</strong>, <strong>drink</strong>, <strong>pose</strong>, <strong>pick up</strong> and much more\u2026 every object can be used in various ways, often with unexpected results.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219160?t=1747355723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747355723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/2574594eb09fee536972faac134ad38e983b5561/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747355723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/2574594eb09fee536972faac134ad38e983b5561/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747355723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3520720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Taverna is a first person adventure in a world of online  taverns. Create and customize your own locale or explore others with up to 16 players (per lobby). Earn gold, complete challenges, unlock items and have fun with role-play.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize your tavern</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/extras/Posing-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1747355723\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paint </strong>walls, <strong>add forniture</strong>, <strong>lights</strong>, and <strong>decorations </strong>to create a unique atmosphere. Every detail in your tavern is yours to customize, making it a welcoming place for friends and fellow adventurers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Voice chat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/extras/Editor43-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1747355723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Communicate vocally</strong> with other players in fun and interactive ways. Organize stand-up comedy nights or just spend the night with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Freedom to create</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/extras/Drawing.gif?t=1747355723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Express yourself</strong> in a variety of ways: <strong>painting, decorating, playing instruments</strong>, and <strong>customizing the environment.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get immersed in a fantasy world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219160/extras/Customization.gif?t=1747355723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your look with different clothing presets and explore a cozy, fantasy tavern straight out of your favorite story or video game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Other features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from between more than <strong>15 roles</strong>. Whether you decide to be a <strong>cook</strong>, a <strong>bard</strong>, or simply a <strong>traveler</strong>, this choice will shape your role-play experience in Taverna by adding a special tag on top of your head.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn gold and use it to <strong>unlock unique items </strong>to progress your tavern. <strong>Chairs</strong>, <strong>pots</strong>, <strong>books</strong>, <strong>cutlery</strong>, <strong>ingredients</strong>, <strong>paints </strong>and so much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Participate in a variety of games and social activities, making every session unique. From classic tavern games to hosting themed events, Taverna is an ideal space for role-play gatherings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a new level of interactivity with <strong>physics</strong>. <strong>Throw</strong>, <strong>flip</strong>, <strong>eat</strong>, <strong>drink</strong>, <strong>pose</strong>, <strong>pick up</strong> and much more\u2026 every object can be used in various ways, often with unexpected results.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Overfort Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co